```
expenses                     (collection)
└── 01                       (document: January ... up to 12)
    └── days                 (subcollection)
        └── 14             (document: the 14th ... up to 31)
            └── orders   (subcollection)
                └── {autoId}  (document: one order)
                      name:     string   "Coffee"
                      quantity: number   2
                      price: number   3.5
```

