Querying is awkward. A query can start at any level, but it can't jump over a level. If you want all orders for a certain day across all years, you have to query each month document separately and then merge the results in your app. For a personal expense tracker this is usually fast enough, because there are only twelve month documents. If you expect hundreds of years of data, you would want a different design.

